{
  "contract": "speechkit.voiceagent.v1",
  "description": "Golden example frames for the realtime Voice Agent WebSocket (GET /v1/voiceagent/sessions/{id}/ws). Producer drift-check: internal/server/voiceagent/protocol_fixture_test.go marshals the Go protocol structs and asserts equality with these frames. Consumers (the TypeScript voiceagent-client and the Android/KMP client) replay the same frames against their codecs. Audio is binary in both directions and is not part of this fixture.",
  "frames": {
